{"message":"Based on the currently documented offers, the strongest quantified sign-up bonus is the EcoCard: earn 2,000 sustainability points—worth $20 as a statement credit or checking-account deposit—after spending $5,000 in eligible purchases within your first month. The offer runs through December 15, 2025, and the card has a $50 annual fee and a 19.99% purchase APR.

I found a previously advertised $500 Silver Rewards Card cash-back bonus, but its offer window ended June 30, 2025, so I can’t treat it as currently available. I also found cash-back multipliers on certain business cards, but those are ongoing earning promotions rather than a one-time sign-up bonus.

If you tell me whether you want a personal or business card and roughly how much you can spend in the first month, I can narrow down which offer is likely to provide the best value."}
